<BaseLayout title="Theory" description="Foundations for electronic-structure theory." current="theory">
  <h1>Theory</h1>
  <p class="lede">Electronic-structure theory draws on mathematics, physics, and chemistry: the language of operators and spectra, the laws governing quantum systems, and the concepts used to interpret atoms, bonds, and solids.</p>
  <h2>Learning Map</h2>
  <p>A future learning map will express dependencies between ideas and allow several points of entry. It will not prescribe a fixed course sequence. This clean baseline does not yet claim a complete map of the field.</p>
</BaseLayout>
